 ['PURPOSE','Overall purpose','Why is the speaker talking? What is the main reason for the message?'],
 ['DETAIL','Specific information','Catch the exact date, time, number, place, person or condition.'],
 ['REASON','Cause & explanation','Understand why something happened or why a decision was made.'],
 ['ACTION','Next step','Identify what the listener should do after hearing the message.'],
 ['SEQUENCE','Order & change','Track what happened first, what changed and what happens next.'],
 ['ATTITUDE','Tone & intention','Recognise whether the speaker is requesting, warning, reassuring or disagreeing.'],
 ['PARAPHRASE','Same meaning, new words','Match spoken language to an answer that uses different wording.'],
 ['INFERENCE','Implied meaning','Use context and stress to understand what is suggested rather than stated directly.']
